---
title: How CPU usage becomes a monthly invoice
config:
  layout: dagre
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 270
    nodeSpacing: 30
    rankSpacing: 45
    useMaxWidth: false
---
%% Numbered boxes explain transformations, not services or SQL statement order.
%% Example: one customer, metric, price version, usage month, and billing month.
%% All 1_000 events are processed before October closes; no add-ons are included.
%% The 2-cent starting credit is illustrative; 1 cent = 1_000_000 ticks.
%% Group and credit boxes show cumulative results after all events are processed.
%% Steps 2-4 commit together for each event; credit uses exact ticks.
%% The worker also maintains booked_charge_cents as a running gross projection.
%% Closing snapshots lines in invoices.snapshot.lines and freezes linked groups.
flowchart TB
    subgraph intake["A. API receives measurements"]
        events["1. Store usage events<br/>1_000 events × 1_000 CPU seconds<br/>Total: 1_000_000 resource units"]
    end

    subgraph processing["B. Worker processes each event atomically (1 cent = 1_000_000 ticks)"]
        direction LR
        rating["2. Price each event (Rating)<br/>Consumption-time price: 5 cents per million units<br/>Ordinary new prices cannot start before insertion<br/>1_000 units → 5_000 money ticks"]
        group["3. Accumulate compatible events<br/>(RatedUsageGroup)<br/>After all events: 1_000_000 units<br/>Gross: 5_000_000 ticks = USD 0.05"]
        credits["4. Apply available usage credit<br/>Starting credit: USD 0.02<br/>Total used: 2_000_000 ticks; left: 0<br/>Final net: 3_000_000 ticks"]

        rating --> group --> credits
    end

    subgraph closing["C. An explicit monthly close builds and freezes the invoice"]
        direction LR
        rounding["5. Round group totals to cents<br/>Gross: 5_000_000 ticks → 5 cents<br/>Net: 3_000_000 ticks → 3 cents<br/>Displayed credit: 5 − 3 = 2 cents"]
        lines["6. Build invoice lines<br/>(InvoiceLine snapshots)<br/>Usage: +USD 0.05<br/>Credit: −USD 0.02"]
        invoice["7. Issue one monthly invoice<br/>Add buyer details and invoice number<br/>Total payable: USD 0.03<br/>Issued values are immutable"]

        rounding --> lines --> invoice
    end

    errors["Any processing_error: retain unprocessed usage<br/>Closing reads only processed groups; no financial effects<br/>Operator SQL repair and explicit release<br/>Recover into an eligible open billing month"]
    rating -.->|"Quarantine"| errors
    errors -.->|"Does not block invoice issuance"| invoice

    intake -->|"Accepted events wait in usage_inbox"| processing
    processing -->|"At closing, lock account and read processed group totals; credit is already allocated"| closing

    classDef input fill:#e9f7ee,stroke:#287d4e,color:#173b28;
    classDef accounting fill:#edf0ff,stroke:#56649c,color:#24335c;
    classDef document fill:#fff4df,stroke:#a66a15,color:#593a0c;
    class events input;
    class rating,group,credits accounting;
    class rounding,lines,invoice document;

    style intake fill:#f7fcf9,stroke:#287d4e,color:#173b28;
    style processing fill:#f8f9ff,stroke:#56649c,color:#24335c;
    style closing fill:#fffbf3,stroke:#a66a15,color:#593a0c;
